.TH MOXY-MOXIN-PATH 1 "" "moxy"
.SH NAME
moxy-moxin-path \- Print default MOXIN_PATH from legacy hierarchy
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B moxy moxin-path
.SH DESCRIPTION
Computes a colon-separated MOXIN_PATH by probing the legacy directory hierarchy (.moxy/moxins/ in cwd, intermediate parents, global config, and system moxins). Only existing directories are included. Usage: export MOXIN_PATH=$(moxy moxin-path)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR moxy (1)
